00:51:45.462 --> 00:51:47.521
in the actual environment you will be tested. And

00:51:47.521 --> 00:51:49.574
that's, of course, where a lot of the power will come But

00:51:49.574 --> 00:51:51.662
this is difficult. So,

00:51:51.822 --> 00:51:53.901
in the real world, it's really great that you

00:51:53.902 --> 00:51:56.272
learn about the real world as it really is,

00:51:56.272 --> 00:51:58.462
