with imitation learning. And the yellow part

01:03:53.802 --> 01:03:55.752
is the RL policy, which is faster

01:03:56.052 --> 01:03:58.282
even the fastest teleoperators. And

01:03:58.282 --> 01:04:00.222
then we ablated each piece of this recipe,

01:04:00.442 --> 01:04:02.522
adding the BCD regularizer, adding the RL

01:04:02.522 --> 01:04:04.681
token, and so on. We found that basically all of them are actually

01:04:04.682 --> 01:04:06.882
helpful. The only ablation

01:04:07.022 --> 01:04:09.262
that comes close to the, RLT method, which

01:04:09.262 --> 01:04:11.412
is in yellow, is the red line. And what

