01:04:18.132 --> 01:04:20.512
makes sense. If the actor gets the representations,

01:04:20.652 --> 01:04:22.821
but it doesn't get the generalist actions,

01:04:22.982 --> 01:04:25.142
can still learn the task. It just has to try more

01:04:25.142 --> 01:04:27.382
stuff to get there, so it takes longer to

01:04:27.382 --> 01:04:29.551
