01:04:29.552 --> 01:04:31.792
token actually makes us, pretty much fall

01:04:31.792 --> 01:04:33.312
apart on these difficult tasks.

01:04:35.072 --> 01:04:37.311
Okay. So so far we've got almost

01:04:37.312 --> 01:04:39.371
all the puzzle pieces. We can

01:04:39.372 --> 01:04:41.611
generate data for our generalist with these

01:04:41.612 --> 01:04:43.672
RL specialists. And the RL specialists itself

01:04:43.672 --> 01:04:46.091
can benefit from the generalist. But

01:04:46.152 --> 01:04:48.231
there's a bit more that we could say about how to

01:04:48.232 --> 01:04:50.402
properly use the RL

01:04:50.402 --> 01:04:52.491
data training the generalist. So

01:04:52.492 --> 01:04:54.652
so far, we've done something very straightforward, which

01:04:54.652 --> 01:04:55.872
is we use the specialist

01:04:56.662 --> 01:04:58.922
to generate datasets and just straight up use imitation

01:04:58.982 --> 01:05:00.841
learning, distillation essentially

01:05:01.472 --> 01:05:03.732
on the specialist to distill into the generalist.

