definition, pretty much every environment is a

02:16:45.022 --> 02:16:46.882
multi agent environment because

02:16:47.942 --> 02:16:50.102
wherever you deploy AI, there's gonna be people

02:16:50.102 --> 02:16:52.122
that are learning and adapting to the AI.

02:16:52.122 --> 02:16:54.282
So how can you use that as an opportunity to actually

02:16:54.282 --> 02:16:56.402
make a better system? So

02:16:56.402 --> 02:16:58.722
we do a lot of this work on reinforcement learning,

02:16:58.722 --> 02:17:01.212
fine tuning of language models, particularly

02:17:01.432 --> 02:17:03.172
from human feedback or even with multi

02:17:03.731 --> 02:17:05.271
